Proof interface
  Large quotient / small gcd: sheet discrepancy gives a positive finite-V floor.
  Small quotient / large gcd: route to a bounded residue atlas; if actual
  speed ratio is <=13, THM-405 closes immediately, otherwise use the
  existing bounded-ratio/finitary LRC<=13 handoff.

Tournament Analysis
  vertices: sheet_discrepancy > bounded_quotient_gate > THM405_first_window
